  "description": "Railer Plus is the big bopper of bikes-moto-inspired and extra fat! You'll be bumpin' down the boardwalk holding onto moto-inspired handlebars, threadless stem and headset all mounted to a lightweight 6000 series aluminum SuperCruise frame. Railer Plus sports rust free alloy rims and stainless-steel spokes and are paired with 26\"x 3\" plus size tires on super wide 56mm alloy rims. Don't be fooled, this oversized bundle of fun is fully capable in the hills as well as the flats thanks to its Shimano Tourney 7 speed drivetrain, Revo twist shifter, and mechanical disc brakes.\n6061 Alloy SuperCruise Plus frame with clearance for the biggest rubber for the smoothest cruise\nForged Alloy 3 Piece crank, 42t\nShimano Tourney TX-35 rear derailleur\nShimano Tourney, 14-28t 7spd freewheel\nRailer design Motocross handlebar with alloy BMX A-head stem\nRailer Plus 56mm alloy rims with stainless steel 14g spokes and Fat 26 x 3.0\" tires\nTektro MD280 Mechanical Disc Brake",
